OL,6,G0900 Four in a Bed
OL,7,     FThe competition kicks off in
OL,8,     FDorset, where creased bedding and
OL,9,     Funwrapped biscuits prove
OL,10,     Fproblematic at Philip and Jimmy's
OL,11,     F17th-century country inn, the Fox
OL,12,     Fand Hounds.
OL,13,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FDespite some excellent first
OL,15,     Fimpressions at Matthew and Moira's
OL,16,     FSurrey glampsite, Milberry Green
OL,17,     FMeadows, the great outdoors soon
OL,18,     Fleave one pair longing for the
OL,19,     Fgreat indoors.
