OL,5,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FCleanliness has been top of the
OL,7,     Fagenda for most of this week's
OL,8,     Fcompetition. So the B&Bers will be
OL,9,     Fkeen to give each other a good
OL,10,     Fdusting down on payment day.
OL,11,G1130 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe competition kicks off in
OL,13,     FInverness, where Dean and his
OL,14,     Fdaughter Chelsie reckon their
OL,15,     FB&B's location will pay dividends,
OL,16,     Fbut their guests baulk at the
OL,17,     Fprices.
OL,18,G1200 Four in a Bed
OL,19,     FOn day two, can singer Marilyn and
OL,20,     Fher mum Agnes hit the high notes
