OL,5,G1230 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FMost of the B&Bers are tickled
OL,7,     Fpink by the pods at Pamela's
OL,8,     FAberdeenshire glampsite - apart
OL,9,     Ffrom one pair, who aren't happy
OL,10,     Fglampers.
OL,11,G1300 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FSharmin and Sarah host the week's
OL,13,     Ffinal visit at their expansive
OL,14,     F35-room hotel in Perth, where the
OL,15,     Fbreakfast setup confuses everyone.
OL,16,G1330 Four in a Bed
OL,17,     FIt's a feisty payment day after a
OL,18,     Fweek packed to the gills with
OL,19,     Fgripes. You could cut the tension
OL,20,     Fwith a knife! Fortunately, we
OL,21,     Fhaven't given any of them knives.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/10
